  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Organizational support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project need has emerged from the close consultative meeting with IRCSL leadership structure identifying the crucial need to continue maintaining their current office. Additionally, the need to continue enhancing communication internally and externally also emerged from the consultation meeting.  This support is critical at the moment as Sierra Leone will be experiencing another democratic and electoral transition in its political history. IRCSL had been very instrumental to create dialogue and mediation of peace across the nation and among political parties. The role of IRCSL had been very instrumental to uphold peace in the land and contributing towards the development and social cohesion in the country. As a moral guarantor of the land, their intervention cannot be overemphasized and CAFOD has used this leverage to dispense various projects through the IRCSL to ensure more recognition about the roles of faith leaders in all moral facets of the country. With these insights, CAFOD will provide the required supports as requested and continuous monitoring of future projects with IRCSL during this period.</narrative>
  </description>
